      },
      "text": "The Vallée de Joux (Valley of Joux) in the Jura mountains of the canton of Vaud is the historical heartland of Swiss complications work. Long winters, poor agricultural land, a tradition of cottage industry (lace-making, then watchmaking), and a concentration of technically sophisticated families."
