      "text": "The ebauche system is the Swiss watch industry's platform architecture: ETA is the movement OS; brands are ISVs building differentiated products on top of it. The \"manufacture vs ebauche-based\" distinction maps exactly to build vs buy. The Swatch Group's threat to cut off ETA supply to competitors (which spawned Sellita as an alternative supplier) is the same dynamic as a platform owner leveraging vertical integration to squeeze third-party competitors — a pattern that recurs across platform economies."
    },
